  "description": "Please configure the DICOM send operation to target the PACS server at **192.168.1.100** on port **104**. The SCU should present itself with the AE title **FLYWHEEL** and address the remote AE titled **PACS_SCU**.\n\nThe input to be transmitted is a **dicom** file, which will be sent using the above network settings.",
